list.item:
Dizdarevic, Raif, Yugoslav Federal
                                Secretary for Foreign Affairs from July 1984 until December 1987;
                                President of Yugoslavia from March 1988

person.note:
Deputy Secretary of Defense from February 1981 until December 1982;
                    President’s Assistant for National Security Affairs from December 1986 until
                    November 1987; Secretary of Defense from November 1987
